The class template basic_stacktrace satisfies the requirements of a reversible container ([container.rev.reqmts]), of an allocator-aware container ([container.alloc.reqmts]), and of a sequence container ([sequence.reqmts]), except that only move, assignment, swap, and operations defined for const-qualified sequence containers are supported and, the semantics of comparison functions are different from those required for a container.

