Mandates: is_convertible_v<iterator_traits<InputIterator>:: value_type, double> is true.

template<class InputIterator>
 discrete_distribution(InputIterator firstW, InputIterator lastW);

Preconditions: InputIterator meets the Cpp17InputIterator requirements ([input.iterators]). If firstW == lastW, let n=1 and w0=1. Otherwise, [firstW, lastW) forms a sequence w of length n>0.

